<title>UK: SOCCER SHOWCASE-SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER SHOWCASE-SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>EDINBURGH 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
