<p>premier division ahead of Saturday's clash between Heart of</p>
<p>Midlothian and Glasgow Rangers (kickoff 1500 GMT):</p>
<p>(tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost, goals for,</p>
<p>against, points)</p>
<p> Rangers		    17  13  2   2  42  16   41</p>
<p> Aberdeen		   17   8  5   4  30  20   29</p>
<p> Celtic		     14   8  3   3  32  15   27</p>
<p> Dundee Utd		 17   5  6   6  19  18   21</p>
<p> Hearts		     17   5  6   6  19  23   21</p>
<p> Dunfermline		16   5  5   6  22  31   20</p>
<p> Hibernian		  17   5  4   8  18  28   19</p>
